  m_text: 'After sleeping in front of the monitor, you''ve been transported to the
    tutorial island in the Ilha Misteriosa game that you were just playing.


    In
    this island you are going to encounter various enemies which you will have to
    fight to harvest your skills, level up and then, try to defeat the island boss
    and you will be granted permission to go back to the real world.


    You can
    save your progress. In case you die and you saved your progress, you will respawn
    in the same location you saved and with the stats you had at that time.


    If
    you complete all island in Ilha Misteriosa, you can take all the stats and skill
    learnt here to the real world.


    Good luck on your adventure!'
