  m_text: 'If you need more info, go to the pause menu - tutorial tab.


    Key
    shortcuts to play on keybord:


    - Move Foward: W/Up arrow key

    - Rotate:
    A/D-Left/Right arrow keys

    - Jump: Space key

    - Attack: F Key

    -
    Pause/Unpause: Escape key

    - Save: E key (Only on Easy and normal modes)'
